            <div xml:id="m-89a703e4-c88c-443a-a311-dd78972a6773">
              <lg xml:id="m-14531b74-b9a2-4fd2-a0a4-96af370bf316">
                <l xml:id="m-d4c101be-6e09-4f8f-b0d0-d9e2d44d4072" facs="#m-55d2cda0-5c32-46e9-9eec-dc1c173bf76e" label="text-like">Tuesday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-8eaaf2f8-88d6-4a91-a562-269b39c8a24e" facs="#m-bc754b0e-5342-495c-bd12-c133c61c8ee1" label="ambiguous">288</l><l xml:id="m-4f436357-2387-4953-8133-711886f90051" facs="#m-b38098e1-1a64-48da-a9fd-03116bb157fd" label="ambiguous">T.</l><l xml:id="m-3dd5e4b4-1e13-4e92-98a1-84d116d8b30c" facs="#m-14762dab-fd3a-4f34-bf2d-6370f35d56be" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-1259a879-a5ad-45ea-9d39-2a33b57a171c" facs="#m-8b9b87f8-c647-4fc1-8a0b-6cfd01003347" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4d2dce08-d157-47db-9690-3d123bc93a2d" facs="#m-75bedb4c-bf99-48ba-a05f-5d923e4f9ed9" label="text-like">TUESDAY AT COMPLINE.</l><l xml:id="m-7455ba4f-329b-40c5-9c61-727afeaa1412" facs="#m-f9551488-7308-435e-a7ca-14acbbf1ae94" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ac33025d-fcb6-476c-a548-2c4c00490003" facs="#m-12461922-ef96-4cad-b537-499b69271dac" label="ambiguous">8.d</l><l xml:id="m-d821cea3-b6d0-4e7a-bf49-874fa4a4bb5c" facs="#m-529155e8-1373-4ad2-b12b-5744dbf8fec0" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-84b88008-f6f6-4768-801e-2e902f41160a" facs="#m-d5124aa3-efe5-4a3f-8a1e-f33e71fb12ef" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-d5b3c4f9-9b2f-422a-bf2b-41ef78b4aec8" facs="#m-385d8381-3723-491d-a49b-9c5dc805a5fe" label="ambiguous">. T.</l><l xml:id="m-689b9892-2ca2-4cd0-9c6b-7cf93f266f77" facs="#m-ab532363-250b-4839-931e-c21e885c3679" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.6</l><l xml:id="m-5effa80d-5837-4399-bd5e-edfd643da633" facs="#m-4a9b7724-c7d0-4fa2-896b-d75a7bc26fb7" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-de040286-8253-49f5-9a38-dd423a7b7f21" facs="#m-16c8fdb0-24ca-45e5-98fb-66b306b60e0f" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-aeed00b4-39f8-4586-a4fe-1f34a31d27b6" facs="#m-44aae1ad-06d8-4487-bcb8-bbf9071f62cf" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-accaf9b0-e1d3-4d49-b5bc-6d223770eb76" facs="#m-53ad12a3-7756-4f4d-91b5-d70238aaba1f" label="ambiguous">Psalm I1.</l><l xml:id="m-a5af36ca-a887-4bd1-aeed-df0800bb1edd" facs="#m-91733022-dadb-457e-a868-c189933714d5" label="lyrics-like">(Alvum me fac Dómine, quóniam defécit sánctus:* quóniam dimi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3d3c804-136f-411b-b152-7d222b3f35b9" facs="#m-51bf2037-f27b-46a1-ba17-24a52f4d6052" label="lyrics-like">O nútae sunt veritátes a filiis hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-eb76b9ca-5ef7-4d9a-8cd1-85bc6da264d1" facs="#m-81042da1-3ee5-45a2-8b49-52937934b0aa" label="lyrics-like">2. Vana locúti sunt unusquisque ad próximum súum:“lábia dolósa,</l><l xml:id="m-1907a44a-8489-46a9-a2b1-44a9d4c76ff2" facs="#m-0f313f95-c2cb-4f6b-8067-8eaffd290c30" label="lyrics-like">in córde et córde loeúti sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-7a398b2b-b5d1-47a9-bce5-5c57c03cc46a" facs="#m-3a1eb439-91c8-420b-b90f-b3f620b1f2d3" label="lyrics-like">3. Dispérdat Dóminus univérsa lábia dolósa, * et linguam magni¬</l><l xml:id="m-cac3e9fb-ac55-44b3-8b5e-ac26f63b326f" facs="#m-45d6d249-73c6-4973-bac9-caaf4bb42971" label="ambiguous">loquam.</l><l xml:id="m-6a1f96ca-d9b8-4ca5-ab9c-736620f88c6c" facs="#m-827a4089-658f-40fc-948b-51c0584956b5" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui dixérunt : Línguam nóstram magnificábimus, t lábia nóstra</l><l xml:id="m-2e6e1172-e54a-40ed-a0d6-4c0dea22a4cf" facs="#m-96c253cd-90c6-4ed6-864c-471c67dd159e" label="lyrics-like">a nóbis sunt:* quis nóster Dóminus est?</l><l xml:id="m-17463444-b7dd-43f9-8a00-ec831b85d70f" facs="#m-f784b4f9-4dfd-4d7d-a269-fa331a051047" label="lyrics-like">5. Propter misériam inopum, et gémitum páuperum, “nunc exsúr¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3004508-5522-40a5-a79e-4d4c0f838cbe" facs="#m-e2910079-2023-4170-9510-130b97b59d55" label="lyrics-like">gam: dícit Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-26c5dae7-190a-437c-8c1a-6e3a316f6ca4" facs="#m-caa0150e-2c41-4bfb-9e02-266b1f20c8df" label="lyrics-like">6. Pónam in salutári:“fiduciáliter ágam in éo.</l><l xml:id="m-a8baf33b-e5fa-481d-88c1-e7902fc950b4" facs="#m-97dc796a-1da1-4eaa-a4f8-700342b233cb" label="lyrics-like">7. Elóquia Dómini, elóquia cásta:* argéntum îgne examinátum,</l><l xml:id="m-8d442f60-31be-4a58-b8e4-458ebbf9867b" facs="#m-3467592b-5aa9-409f-8661-35dcb8dba47a" label="lyrics-like">probátum térrae, purgátum séptuplum.</l><l xml:id="m-8e290362-c184-4967-b87b-990763080d70" facs="#m-4c0edff7-f839-4733-a672-ae3776b66451" label="lyrics-like">8. Tu Dómine servábis nos, et custódies nos, *a generatióne hac in</l><l xml:id="m-b5178634-4982-4305-bab8-ed777dd04118" facs="#m-766f7d4d-dbbf-4a9d-a6bf-610b864a4e71" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-a23e147e-3832-4cbf-a8b2-1e321bdd0b35" facs="#m-beb0b6e4-14d3-49e5-bc25-0e420dc6d954" label="lyrics-like">9. In circúitu impii ámbulant:“secúndum altitúdinem túam multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-48cd6e58-7658-4b8d-96ea-ad409b1a8eb0" facs="#m-d04785bf-749c-48c1-9cc9-2bfd7ad29c33" label="lyrics-like">plicásti filios hóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b1d280ea-a7e6-4faf-989b-4b0f3f7229d7" facs="#m-afb0e000-8b72-4a64-9305-ee91b8768bee" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-c0a32ab4-58d1-49f5-8624-531764e7e442" facs="#m-e83b869e-c471-49b2-9a25-25249eb8c3c7" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-02db752b-f1db-46b1-8d34-1c3426f910fd" facs="#m-6b3e4ab8-189d-4d2b-831f-30edee829a5d" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e498c1b4-ef50-42e9-a234-984183f546b5" facs="#m-2c90e905-c696-46da-9ccd-830170f1674c" label="ambiguous">Psalm 12.</l><l xml:id="m-9db30368-7afa-42cd-ba96-c1172803fd1f" facs="#m-4eefc8fd-e27b-4c56-8853-24e745fe405e" label="lyrics-like">Squequo Dómine obliviscéris me in finem?*úsquequo avérti:</l><l xml:id="m-39b19591-8c4c-48b4-b858-566fcf649219" facs="#m-a7c4796c-5443-41ce-b898-7fbc18384548" label="lyrics-like">Ul fáciem túam a me?</l><l xml:id="m-604df9cc-164c-461d-81a6-9f3589140bda" facs="#m-1f8edef3-0f72-45c5-8185-95889a9306f3" label="lyrics-like">2. Quámdiu pónam consilia in ánima méa, “ dolórem in córde méc</l><l xml:id="m-abd931a3-5eab-4b2e-86c3-aa08af8448c1" facs="#m-899360f2-6ff7-4971-a57b-7fddb9e3d621" label="ambiguous">per diem?</l><l xml:id="m-5d9dd5c1-b5eb-484e-b9cc-897e6ad97503" facs="#m-b1b1c4e5-32da-450b-bc70-dbd421107873" label="lyrics-like">3. Usquequo exaltábitur inimícus méus súper me?*réspice, e</l><l xml:id="m-1467874a-8f47-4be0-9e29-9d863c5cdd49" facs="#m-929f4a62-c69e-419a-961b-2968cd851987" label="lyrics-like">exáudi me Dõmine Déus méus.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
